    "heading": "Le boucle Barnave (Vercors, Drome department)",
    "highlight": "New stabilized AV1 version as of December 24th 2022: To update your existing video, just delete it within Incyclist, overwrite the old video and both control files with the new ones. Then import the new video in Incyclist as usual.",
    "description": "A round course in the French Diois region. We start near the village of Barnave and climb the Col de Pennes passing some grape plantations where harvesting is being done. The grapes in the region are mostly Clairette or Muscat which are used for making the regional speciality and famous \"Clairette de Die\". We don't go all the way to the highest point of the pass, but return after about two third of the ascent so that the loop is not too hard. The ride offers nice views on beautiful mountainous surroundings.",
